{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MeXvHXW9292styudeGDQMo","type":"tool_result","content":"# Implementation: Android widget foundation and read-only \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: story\ndeveloper:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What was implemented, task by task. Reference task IDs. -->\n\n## Changes\n\n<!-- List of files changed and what changed in each. -->\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->\n# Verdict: Android widget foundation and read-only \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: story\nreviewer:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\n\n## Review\n\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\n     notes: ...\n\nTASK-2: ...\n-->\n\n## Security\n\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n\n## Overall\n\n<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\n<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\nee8fe68 [story] chore: commit all\n7c6ffcc [story] chore: commit all\nb124209 Scaffold job story_android-widget-foundation-and-read-only-your-day-widget\n2e82b9a backlog: widget contract uses the bare server URL; vendoring already done\n2e91d0c Vendor frontend from app (widget bridge, server logout, Italian)\nb8d84ae backlog: spell out the action contract in the tap-to-complete entry\n8dc8c67 backlog: spell out the API and bridge contract in the widget foundation entry\n1e3d405 android report\n797b372 backlog: tap-to-complete on the Your Day widget\n367c00e backlog: Android widget foundation and read-only Your Day widget\nd60bf19 Widget architecture decisions for Android home-screen widgets\n0e8b083 Merge branch 'main' of github.com:solyto/mobile\ne5faa82 Use high-res logo in StaggeredLogo for sharp rendering on HiDPI screens\n0fbc398 chore: release v1.1.1\n9672c30 Changelog 1.1.1: add the date picker and mobile menu fixes\n9b292c0 chore: release v1.1.1\n2ebe0fd Changelog 1.1.1\n42864c4 fix: blend Skyrim bar colours with its overlay, hide WebView gap below page\n25bbb0b sync\n20f5a5a frontend\n5d35f9a chore: add sodevto dev APK build\n96078df feat: match system bar colours to the app theme\n8c629a8 fix: keep WebView above keyboard under edge-to-edge\nfb6bfae package-lock\n0147b10 chore: release v1.1.0\n9558ea0 F-Droid changelog 1.1.0: mention the UI improvements\n05429ea F-Droid changelog 1.1.0: replace the password line with the todo editor\n7fef0bf Add the F-Droid changelog for 1.1.0\n4438397 Remove DuckDuckGo from the F-Droid description, icons now load through the solyto server\n8179758 New app version included","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"af113cdf-2a00-442d-a3a5-a4319c5fcc06","uuid":"5c3836aa-f243-45f4-950f-83c291ed9c52","timestamp":"2026-10-29T16:44:04.492Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"# Implementation: Android widget foundation and read-only \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: story\ndeveloper:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\n<!-- What was implemented, task by task. Reference task IDs. -->\n\n## Changes\n\n<!-- List of files changed and what changed in each. -->\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n<!-- Anything that came up during implementation that wasn't in scope but should be tracked. -->\n# Verdict: Android widget foundation and read-only \"Your Day\" widget\n\nid: story\nreviewer:\ndate:\n\n<!-- Produced by @reviewer and/or @security after implementation. -->\n\n## Review\n\n<!-- TASK-1: PASS / FAIL / PARTIAL\n     notes: ...\n\nTASK-2: ...\n-->\n\n## Security\n\n<!-- Any security findings from @security, or \"none\" if not run. -->\n\n## Overall\n\n<!-- APPROVED / REJECTED / NEEDS WORK -->\n<!-- Summary of what needs to change before this can be approved, if anything. -->\nee8fe68 [story] chore: commit all\n7c6ffcc [story] chore: commit all\nb124209 Scaffold job story_android-widg